{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1484368-merit-question-favored-form","id":1484368,"title":"Merit question: Favored Form","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-18T09:55:20-07:00","id":1484368,"title":"Merit question: Favored Form","content":"Is that merit like combat merit: Ex: Martial arts ? Do we have to take dot 1, before taking do 2, and etc ?<br /> If we have to, do all progressive level of that merit adds up, or do we take only the highest dot version ?<br /> <br /> Can we take this merit multiple time ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2986-warriorshaman","name":"Warriorshaman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-18T12:00:22-07:00","id":1484376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Warriorshaman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1484368-merit-question-favored-form#post1484368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that merit like combat merit: Ex: Martial arts ? Do we have to take dot 1, before taking do 2, and etc ?<br /> If we have to, do all progressive level of that merit adds up, or do we take only the highest dot version ?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's listed as a single Merit and it states that each dot gives its respective benefit as an &quot;additional advantage.&quot; The Drawback scales with how many dots you have in the Merit. If you put two dots into Favored Form, you have the effects of both the first dot and the second dot for that form.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can we take this merit multiple time ? </div> </div> </div>Explicitly no.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Werewolf: the Forsaken 2e Core Rulebook, p106, Favored Form Merit description</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Note: You may only choose this Merit for a single form.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-18T14:00:23-07:00","id":1484385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Warriorshaman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1484368-merit-question-favored-form#post1484368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that merit like combat merit: Ex: Martial arts ? Do we have to take dot 1, before taking do 2, and etc ?<br /> If we have to, do all progressive level of that merit adds up, or do we take only the highest dot version ?</div> </div> </div> </div>In Second Edition rules, when you purchase a dot of a trait, you just pay the experience cost of the new dot.<br /> <br /> If you start with no dots in Favored Form...<ul><li>...and you buy Favored Form \u25cf, you pay 1 experience, the cost of one new Merit dot. You receive the benefits listed for Favored Form \u25cf.</li> <li>...and you buy Favored Form \u25cf\u25cf, you pay 2 experiences, the cost of two new Merit dots. You receive the benefits listed for Favored Form \u25cf and for Favored Form \u25cf\u25cf.</li> <li>...and you buy Favored Form \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf, you pay 3 experiences, the cost of three new Merit dots. You receive the benefits listed for Favored Form \u25cf, \u25cf\u25cf, and \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf.</li> </ul><br /> ...and so on.<br /> <br /> If you start with Favored Form \u25cf and you buy Favored Form \u25cf\u25cf, you pay 1 experience, the cost of one new Merit dot. Now you receive the benefits for both Favored Form \u25cf and \u25cf\u25cf instead of just Favored Form \u25cf.<br /> <br /> In First Edition rules this worked differently, and for every new dot of a Merit you bought, you had to pay the escalating (new rating x 2) xp cost, so that if you started with no dots and bought two, you would have to pay (2 xp for raising to \u25cf) + (4 xp for raising to \u25cf\u25cf) = 6 xp. In Second Edition, experience costs no longer scale like this. You're still technically paying the cost to raise your Merit rating dot by dot, but the cost for each individual dot increase is always 1 experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 06-18-2022, 05:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}